#: ../../examples/sessions.rst:2
msgid "Restore SQLite history"
msgstr "恢复 SQLite 历史记录"

#: ../../examples/sessions.rst:4
msgid "Reopen a real temporary database, restore history, paginate messages, update the title, and delete the session."
msgstr "重新打开一个真实的临时数据库，恢复历史记录，对消息分页，更新标题，然后删除会话。"

#: ../../examples/sessions.rst:7
msgid "Run it"
msgstr "运行示例"

#: ../../examples/sessions.rst:9
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录下："

#: ../../examples/sessions.rst:15
msgid "The output includes:"
msgstr "输出包含："

#: ../../examples/sessions.rst:21
msgid "This program uses deterministic offline models and temporary storage where needed. It requires no API key and is executed by the documentation test suite."
msgstr "这个程序使用确定性的离线模型，并在需要时使用临时存储。它不需要 API 密钥，由文档测试套件执行。"

#: ../../examples/sessions.rst:25
msgid "What to take into your application"
msgstr "可以带入你应用的做法"

#: ../../examples/sessions.rst:27
msgid "Keep one stable ``session_id`` for a conversation and open a persistence extension over the same database when the process restarts. The example closes the first connection before creating a second client, so the restored history comes from SQLite, not an in-memory cache."
msgstr "为一个对话保留一个稳定的 ``session_id``，并在进程重启时针对同一个数据库打开持久化扩展。示例在创建第二个客户端之前先关闭了第一个连接，因此恢复的历史记录来自 SQLite，而不是内存缓存。"

#: ../../examples/sessions.rst:36
msgid "The example also paginates messages, renames the conversation, and deletes it. It only deletes a session in a temporary database. In your application, session deletion removes history; put it behind an explicit user action."
msgstr "示例还会对消息分页、重命名对话并删除它。它只删除临时数据库中的会话。在你的应用中，删除会话会移除历史记录；应把它置于明确的用户操作之后。"

